    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d466">

                <pb facs="0557" n="461" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg461"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Baron de Fava.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-09-14"><hi rendition="#italic">September 14,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Answering your note of to-day, I beg
                    to say that the sense of the governor’s telegram was almost textually given in
                    my note to you, and that it is silent as to the details you mention.</p>
                <p>Hastily, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
